================================================================================

Honesty posture
---------------
This is a BEHAVIOR-FROZEN presentation phase. Its implementation surface is CSS
(app.css re-clothing + --xy-* chrome tokens) plus two canvas-level React Flow
props (defaultEdgeOptions marker, Background lines variant) and one hidden
<marker> def. That surface is overwhelmingly WALK-GATED: the plate look,
