Deviations
----------
- Background variant supplied as `BackgroundVariant.Lines` (the enum), not the
  raw string "lines": TS types the prop as `BackgroundVariant | undefined`, so
  the raw string fails tsc. The design explicitly permits either form ("import
  BackgroundVariant or the string per RF's prop type"). No behavior difference.

